#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:59
msgid ""
"Songs, artists and genres, with guitar and bass tabs, chords, lyrics, keys, "
"tunings and sheet music — written by musicians, for anyone learning to play."
msgstr ""

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:64
msgid ""
"The WikiMusic project is an non-profit community, with the goal of knowledge "
"sharing and musical education, providing an open platform for exploring, "
"sharing, and learning about music in all its forms."
msgstr ""
"El proyecto WikiMusic es una comunidad sin ánimo de lucro cuyo objetivo es "
"compartir conocimiento y educación musical, ofreciendo una plataforma "
"abierta para explorar, compartir y aprender sobre la música en todas sus "
"formas."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:69
msgid ""
"Whether you're a musician, educator, researcher, or simply a music lover, "
"WikiMusic empowers you to:"
msgstr ""
"Tanto si eres músico, docente, investigador o simplemente un amante de la "
"música, WikiMusic te permite:"

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:77
msgid "Discover music from diverse genres and traditions."
msgstr "Descubrir música de diversos géneros y tradiciones."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:79
msgid "Organize information with structured metadata and multimedia content."
msgstr ""
"Organizar la información con metadatos estructurados y contenido multimedia."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:81
msgid ""
"Contribute by adding new compositions, analyses, or educational materials."
msgstr ""
"Contribuir añadiendo nuevas composiciones, análisis o materiales educativos."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:83
msgid ""
"Learn through curated resources that connect music theory, history, and "
"practice."
msgstr ""
"Aprender con recursos seleccionados que conectan la teoría musical, la "
"historia y la práctica."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:94
msgid ""
"At its core, WikiMusic leverages the expressive power of Lisp to build a "
"dynamic interactive Music Gallery and Content Management System (CMS)."
msgstr ""
"En esencia, WikiMusic aprovecha la potencia expresiva de Lisp para construir "
"una galería de música interactiva y dinámica y un sistema de gestión de "
"contenidos (CMS)."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:96
msgid ""
"WikiMusic leverages a database-backed architecture to ensure all content is "
"easily searchable, linkable, and reusable. "
msgstr ""
"WikiMusic se apoya en una arquitectura basada en base de datos para que todo "
"el contenido sea fácilmente buscable, enlazable y reutilizable. "

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:98
msgid ""
"The user interface provides a seamless experience, inviting both beginners "
"and experts to engage with the world of music collaboratively."
msgstr ""
"La interfaz ofrece una experiencia fluida e invita tanto a principiantes "
"como a expertos a colaborar en el mundo de la música."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:105
msgid "donate what you can, by clicking here"
msgstr "dona lo que puedas, haciendo clic aquí"

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:110
msgid ""
"This helps us keep the underlying cloud infrastructure and the contributor's "
"work hours going strong."
msgstr ""
"Esto nos ayuda a mantener la infraestructura en la nube subyacente y las "
"horas de trabajo de los colaboradores."

#: lib/wikimusic/prose.scm:115
msgid ""
"Join us in building an ever-growing library of musical knowledge — where "
"every note tells a story."
msgstr ""
"Únete a nosotros para construir una biblioteca de conocimiento musical en "
"constante crecimiento — donde cada nota cuenta una historia."

